{
  "public_post": "Notice: The Millbrook bakery co-op is closed today; all bread sold earlier is being recalled and refunded, and we will reopen once safe flour is obtained.",
  "coop_message": "Team, please process refunds for any sold loaves, discard all contaminated inventory, and begin sourcing a safe flour batch immediately; keep me posted on progress.",
