{
  "public_post": "The Millbrook bakery co-op remains closed today due to contaminated flour. All loaves purchased yesterday will be fully refunded. We are sourcing safe flour and will reopen tomorrow with a fresh batch.",
  "coop_message": "Team, we must (1) process refunds for all day‑1 sales immediately (Lena, handle the ledger), (2) discard any remaining contaminated loaves and flour (Kai, arrange disposal), (3) contact the supplier for safe flour delivery (Quin, negotiate urgent shipment), and (4) draft a clear public notice for tomorrow (all). Let’s reconvene at noon to confirm the new opening time with the council.",
  "reason": "To protect villagers' health by halting sales, refunding affected customers, and preparing a safe reopening."
}

{
  "public_post": "Notice: The Millbrook bakery co-op will remain closed today due to contaminated flour; we will not sell any bread until safe flour is secured. Please do not consume any of our bread.",
  "coop_message": "All members: Immediately stop all sales and recall any unsold loaves; issue refunds to any customers who bought today. Begin sourcing certified safe flour and coordinate with the council to announce the closure and safety steps. Update me on progress by end of day.",
  "reason": "To protect villagers' health, halt contaminated sales, and organize a recall and safe flour replacement."
}

{
  "public_post": "Important update: Safe flour has been secured and we will reopen tomorrow at 8 am. All loaves purchased earlier this week will be fully refunded—please return any you have. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "Team, please: Quin – confirm delivery time with the supplier and inform the council of our reopening at 8 am tomorrow; Lena – finalize the refund ledger and ensure all refunds are processed today; Uma – draft the public reopening notice for the board and coordinate with the council schedule; I’ll prepare the new dough batch once the flour arrives.",
  "reason": "We need to inform villagers of the reopening plan and coordinate final tasks to ensure refunds and safe production."
}

{
  "public_post": "Notice: The Millbrook bakery co-op remains closed today due to contaminated flour; all purchases from yesterday have been fully refunded; we will reopen tomorrow if safe flour is secured and the council approves; please do not consume any of our bread.",
  "coop_message": "Team, please confirm whether the safe‑flour shipment has arrived and if the council has approved a reopening time for tomorrow. Ensure all day‑1 refunds are logged (Lena), and finalize the refund ledger (Kai). Once we have safe flour, I'll negotiate any urgent delivery costs. Let's reconvene at noon with a clear plan.",
  "reason": "Update villagers on the continued closure and coordinate final steps to safely reopen the co‑op."
}

{
  "public_post": "Notice: The Millbrook bakery co-op remains closed today due to contaminated flour; all previous loaves have been recalled and refunded. We are sourcing certified safe flour and will reopen as soon as it arrives. Please do not consume any co-op bread.",
  "coop_message": "Team, refunds for day‑1 and day‑2 sales have been completed and all contaminated inventory has been disposed of. Supplier confirms safe flour will arrive by tomorrow morning. Let's plan to reopen on day 4 pending confirmation; please prep the ovens and arrange a final safety check with the council.",
  "reason": "To keep villagers safe while coordinating the final steps needed to resume operations."
}

{
  "public_post": "The Millbrook bakery co‑op will reopen tomorrow (Day 4) at 8 am with safe, certified flour. All refunds for contaminated loaves have been processed; please return any affected bread for a full refund. Thank you for your patience and stay safe.",
  "coop_message": "Safe flour has arrived today. Plan: Kai – begin dough preparation this afternoon; Lena – conduct final safety inspection before baking; Quin – confirm opening time with the council and update the board schedule; I’ll finalize the public reopening notice now. We aim to open tomorrow at 8 am pending council approval.",
  "reason": "To announce the reopening to villagers and coordinate final tasks with co‑op members."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news! Our bakery is fully operational with safe, certified flour. All previous loaves have been refunded. Come enjoy fresh bread today—10% off as a thank‑you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "Team, please confirm we have sufficient safe flour for today and tomorrow and that the council has no further objections; also begin ordering the next batch to maintain steady supply.",
  "reason": "Encourage sales while ensuring logistics and council approval are confirmed."
}

{
